OL,3,GNEWSAJurors unable to reach verdict for
OL,4,Afinal gas worker
OL,5,
OL,6,FJurors deliberating in the case of a
OL,7,Fgas worker on trial for gross
OL,8,Fnegligence manslaughter after a fatal
OL,9,Fexplosion have been discharged after
OL,10,Ffailing to reach a verdict.
OL,12,FTen people died following an explosion
OL,13,Fat Haut du Mont flats in Jersey in the
OL,14,Fearly hours of 10 December 2022.
OL,16,FLee Ward denied 10 counts of gross
OL,17,Fnegligence manslaughter at Jersey Royal
OL,18,FCourt. Neil Armstrong and John Wright
OL,19,Fwere found guilty on Wednesday and
OL,20,FIsland Energy was found guilty for
OL,21,Fhealth and safety breaches.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
